  "id": "multisensory-method",
  "term": "multisensory method",
  "definition": "A multisensory method is a learning approach that uses more than one sense at the same time, such as combining visual and haptic exploration of a stimulus. In the described study, this approach improved learning of visual-auditory associations compared with a visual-only method.",
